        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By collaborating with our customers, we have opportunities to develop high value-added, customized products and solutions for them that leverage our existing technologies.",
        "start_character": 25568,
        "end_character": 25739
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001730168-25-000121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001730168-25-000121-06d618a7e0bacc1d",
        "accession_number": "0001730168-25-000121",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also expect competition in these markets to continue to increase as existing competitors improve or expand their product offerings and as new companies, including some of our customers, enter the markets.",
        "start_character": 32854,
        "end_character": 33061
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001730168-25-000121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001730168-25-000121-06d618a7e0bacc1d",
        "accession_number": "0001730168-25-000121",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also invest in process development and improvements to product features and functions, as well as fabrication capabilities to optimize processes for devices that are manufactured internally.",
        "start_character": 24899,
        "end_character": 25092
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001730168-25-000121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001730168-25-000121-06d618a7e0bacc1d",
        "accession_number": "0001730168-25-000121",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also license third-party technologies that are incorporated into some elements of our design activities, products and manufacturing processes.",
        "start_character": 35662,
        "end_character": 35807
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001730168-25-000121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001730168-25-000121-06d618a7e0bacc1d",
        "accession_number": "0001730168-25-000121",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also sell our products to a wide variety of OEMs or their CMs.",
        "start_character": 27311,
        "end_character": 27376
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001730168-25-000121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001730168-25-000121-06d618a7e0bacc1d",
        "accession_number": "0001730168-25-000121",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We anticipate that we will continue to make significant research and development investments in order to maintain our competitive position, and to ensure a continuous flow of innovative and retentive products and solutions.",
        "start_character": 25740,
        "end_character": 25963
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001730168-25-000121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001730168-25-000121-06d618a7e0bacc1d",
        "accession_number": "0001730168-25-000121",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are committed to continuous investment in product development and enhancement, with a focus on rapidly introducing new, proprietary products and releases.",
        "start_character": 23829,
        "end_character": 23986
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001730168-25-000121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001730168-25-000121-06d618a7e0bacc1d",
        "accession_number": "0001730168-25-000121",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We develop semiconductor products that enable accelerated compute and networking connectivity deployed in enterprise and AI data centers and service providers for their workloads.",
        "start_character": 4063,
        "end_character": 4242
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001730168-25-000121",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001730168-25-000121-06d618a7e0bacc1d",
        "accession_number": "0001730168-25-000121",
        "filing_date": "2025-12-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We differentiate ourselves through our high-performance design and integration capabilities, and focus on developing semiconductor products for markets that require our high quality, leading technology and integrated performance semiconductor and semiconductor-based solutions.",
        "start_character": 2410,
        "end_character": 2687
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001730168-25-000121",
